WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:08.206
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:14.131
What do they see?

3
00:00:14.132 --> 00:00:25.926
They see kites in the sky.

4
00:00:25.927 --> 00:00:57.545
The blobs want a kite too.

5
00:00:57.546 --> 00:01:03.621
They cut some paper.

6
00:01:03.622 --> 00:01:16.019
They glue their paper together.

7
00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:30.801
They tape sticks to the paper.

8
00:01:30.802 --> 00:01:50.855
They tie string to the sticks.

9
00:01:50.856 --> 00:02:01.085
They add a long tail.

10
00:02:01.086 --> 00:02:04.584
Now the blobs have a kite!

11
00:02:04.585 --> 00:02:15.461
Cool kite, blobs.

12
00:02:15.462 --> 00:02:21.604
The blobs fly their kite.

13
00:02:21.605 --> 00:02:29.376
Blobs, it's too windy now.

14
00:02:29.377 --> 00:02:37.767
Oh no! The kite flies away.

15
00:02:37.768 --> 00:02:41.013
Silly blobs!

16
00:02:41.014 --> 00:02:44.945
Good-bye!

